.TH KEYLIGHTD 1 "August 2026" "keylightd 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
keylightd \- control an Elgato Key Light from camera activity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B keylightd
.I COMMAND
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B keylightd
detects completed V4L2 camera frames, turns on an Elgato Key Light, and restores its previous power and brightness state after capture stops.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B daemon
Run the per-user Key Light controller.
.TP
.B camera-monitor
Run the privileged V4L2 frame monitor.
.TP
.B discover
Discover the Key Light and print its state.
.TP
.B sensor
Print the ambient-light reading.
.TP
.B calibrate
Save an ambient-light to brightness calibration point.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/keylightd/config.toml
Per-user configuration.
.TP
.I /run/keylightd/camera-active
Camera state published by the privileged monitor.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR systemctl (1)
